---
---
<section class="section-usable-version" id="v1">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="uv-frame">
      
      <div class="uv-header">
        <span class="uv-eyebrow">Un început bine delimitat</span>
        <h2 class="uv-title">Prima versiune rezolvă mai întâi partea cea mai importantă.</h2>
        <p class="uv-desc">
          Nu orice funcție este necesară de la început. O primă versiune clar delimitată poate susține procesul central și crea o bază pentru extinderi ulterioare.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="uv-content">
        <ul class="uv-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="uv-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>procesul central susținut mai întâi;</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="uv-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>funcțiile necesare pentru utilizare;</span>
          </li>
          <li class="excluded">
            <svg class="uv-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>ce nu face intenționat parte din prima versiune;</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="uv-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>criteriile de verificare a soluției;</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="uv-icon text-muted" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4">
              <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">extinderile posibile ulterior.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-usable-version {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .uv-frame {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-navy);
    padding: 5rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  /* Target brackets effect at corners */
  .uv-frame::before, .uv-frame::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border: 2px solid var(--brand-navy);
  }
  .uv-frame::before {
    top: -6px; left: -6px;
    border-right: none; border-bottom: none;
  }
  .uv-frame::after {
    bottom: -6px; right: -6px;
    border-left: none; border-top: none;
  }

  .uv-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .uv-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .uv-desc {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .uv-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .uv-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }
  
  .uv-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }

  .excluded { color: var(--text-muted) !important; text-decoration: line-through; }
  .excluded .uv-icon { color: var(--border-subtle); }

  .text-muted { color: var(--text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .uv-frame {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .uv-list li {
      text-align: left;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .uv-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>

